<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Serious">>
Raju: Their coach is watching from the boundary.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Serious">>
Ramu: Let him. Your coach is the handpump at dawn. Show them what that teaches.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: Face up chin up.

